 name←CaseCodePart name;bin;digits;len;⎕IO
⍝ case-code a string
 ⎕IO←0
 →0⍴⍨0∊⍴name  ⍝ empty name doesn't get case coded
 →0⍴⍨'⎕'=↑name  ⍝ sysvar doesn't get case coded
 bin←name∊'ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ'
 len←⌈3÷⍨↑⍴,bin
 digits←2⊥⌽⍉⌽len 3⍴bin↑⍨3×len
 digits←digits↓⍨+/^\0=digits
 name,←'-','0123456789'[digits,0⍴⍨⍬≡digits]